WEBVTT

NOTE
Transcribed with whisper.cpp large-v3-turbo, then hand-corrected. Cue times are
clip-relative; the clip is master 45.80s–74.85s, so subtract 45.80 to map back.
One correction the model got wrong twice, at both model sizes: it heard "go TRY
to the point" where he says "go STRAIGHT to the point". His own word order is
kept everywhere else ("how to do correctly an exercise") — he is understandable
and it is what he said.

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.400
After work is like, you're tired.

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.220
You don't want to spend time
thinking too much.

3
00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.630
You don't want to spend time
looking for what to do.

4
00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:10.800
You want to go straight to the point,

5
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.100
you don't want to mess around.

6
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:18.540
What I love about Libo is that
I already use some other stuff,

7
00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:23.200
but the thing is that you really can focus.

8
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.720
You spend months — literally months —

9
00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:29.020
trying to learn how to do
correctly an exercise.
